==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Using any [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]] can make this level very easy. Use cats like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] to stall St. Pigge the 2nd and to protect the anti-Reds.

